OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits charges related to hoax
OL,4,Abomb outside police station
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from County Tyrone has admitted
OL,7,Fto charges related to a hoax bomb that
OL,8,Fwas left at a police station.
OL,10,FA motorist was forced to drive the
OL,11,Fsuspicious object to the station in
OL,12,FOmagh after being held at gunpoint on 6
OL,13,FMay 2023.
OL,15,FThe car was hijacked by three masked
OL,16,Fmen near a church near Fireagh Road,
OL,17,Foff the Dromore Road, and several homes
OL,18,Fwere evacuated near the station on the
OL,19,FDerry Road.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
