OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits charges related to hoax
OL,4,Abomb outside police station
OL,5,
OL,6,FSean Pearson, from Culmore Park, Omagh,
OL,7,Fpleaded guilty to four charges in
OL,8,FBelfast Crown Court on Monday.
